          ],
          "requirement_id": "TFQM-REFINEMENT-REVIEW-DFM-CONTINUUM-REFINEMENT-LIMIT-1"
        },
        {
          "requirement": "Require a callable edge assignment, validate words/depth before invoking it, and call each leaf once. Scalar transport accepts only exact int/Fraction callback results and bounds each accumulation. Ordered transport validates each S3 callback result and multiplies later factors on the left. Aggregate methods return Outcome; expected failures/cancellation retain their declared behavior.",
