          "requirement": "Use the fixed15-word fixture population and explicit Cases recorders. Factor the original geometric grid into word/depth checks without changing obligations. Check exact leaf sums, split envelopes, binary2q accumulation and endpoint-gauge telescoping; preserve alternating perturbations, the omitted-binary-factor negative control and the excluded q=1/2 threshold. Private fixture parameters/callbacks are trusted exact values, not a new general convergence API.",
