      "consumer_boundary": "Executable path and all prior callable entry points remain. Legacy leaf ordering and list format, little-endian words, permutation order and14642-obligation receipt remain. Scalar callbacks now exclude bool/float/foreign values and every exact accumulation has a4096-bit budget. DyadicCell owns immutable words and adds Outcome operations. Deep scalar/control loops are factored into small functions; fixed fixture generation has no arbitrary size argument. Callbacks are trusted synchronous repository functions, not untrusted code or a bounded-time service. The Lean origin supplies completeness, metric and geometric-decay hypotheses; no scientific DAG status is promoted."
